    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can dwarf only bury their heads in mining? No ! From the day they invented the Magic Dice, they had other options. For example, conquering the world .. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drag Dices to destroy enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reasonably utilize the functions of different types of dice to maximize their effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/2dd28118857faa1823b425dc6452a202.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/2dd28118857faa1823b425dc6452a202.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/2dd28118857faa1823b425dc6452a202.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade you Dices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously collect and strengthen dice on the road of conquest, enhancing one's own combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/262a48de30daaa8bcb268cbddb57a5e5.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/262a48de30daaa8bcb268cbddb57a5e5.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/262a48de30daaa8bcb268cbddb57a5e5.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Goblins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By chance, you may encounter escaping goblins. Don't let them escape, otherwise they will steal your gold coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/ae8124a6c876cc86181813de84a1797f.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/ae8124a6c876cc86181813de84a1797f.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/ae8124a6c876cc86181813de84a1797f.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies have their own characteristics and weaknesses, and different strategies should be adopted to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/4ee799331f6021708a4e31678a3eaf67.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/4ee799331f6021708a4e31678a3eaf67.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/4ee799331f6021708a4e31678a3eaf67.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can dwarf only bury their heads in mining? No ! From the day they invented the Magic Dice, they had other options. For example, conquering the world .. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drag Dices to destroy enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reasonably utilize the functions of different types of dice to maximize their effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/2dd28118857faa1823b425dc6452a202.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/2dd28118857faa1823b425dc6452a202.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/2dd28118857faa1823b425dc6452a202.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade you Dices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously collect and strengthen dice on the road of conquest, enhancing one's own combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/262a48de30daaa8bcb268cbddb57a5e5.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/262a48de30daaa8bcb268cbddb57a5e5.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/262a48de30daaa8bcb268cbddb57a5e5.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Goblins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By chance, you may encounter escaping goblins. Don't let them escape, otherwise they will steal your gold coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/ae8124a6c876cc86181813de84a1797f.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/ae8124a6c876cc86181813de84a1797f.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/ae8124a6c876cc86181813de84a1797f.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies have their own characteristics and weaknesses, and different strategies should be adopted to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/4ee799331f6021708a4e31678a3eaf67.poster.avif?t=1751859450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/4ee799331f6021708a4e31678a3eaf67.webm?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/4ee799331f6021708a4e31678a3eaf67.mp4?t=1751859450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
